Disney has updated the release dates for its most anticipated upcoming titles:

• Alien: Romulus arrives on August 16, 2024;  
• Zootopia 2 launches November 26, 2025;  
• The Mandalorian and Grogu, the Moana video game remake, Frozen 3, and Toy Story 5 are all slated for 2026.

